<translation id="1749753408579541220">Uma ivuliwe, i-FlyWeb ikhulula inkumbulo kumathebhu angasebenzi. Lokhu kunikeza amathebhu asebenzayo namanye ama-app izinsiza zekhompyutha ezengeziwe futhi kugcina i-FlyWeb ishesha. Amathebhu akho angasebenzi aphinde asebenze ngokuzenzakalelayo uma ubuyela kuwo.</translation>
